cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gorti in research, please cite the software using this metadata."
type: software
title: "gorti: An open-source HLA Run-Time Infrastructure in Go"
abstract: >-
  gorti is an open-source Run-Time Infrastructure implemented in Go,
  targeting the IEEE 1516-2010 HLA family. A standalone server connects
  Go, Python, and Java federates. Modular HLA services, model integration
  examples, design documents, and requirement-derived test cases support
  simulation development and distributed-simulation education.
authors:
